&lt;p&gt;We have reached the end of this infrastructure journey. By now, you should have a solid understanding of how to provision and manage cloud infrastructure using Terraform. You've built a complete three-tier web application architecture on AWS, covering everything from networking and compute to security and data storage.&lt;/p&gt;

